9. `AGENTS.md` (unslopped, sentence-case headings, no emoji). Structure:
   - Top: the ponytail ruleset at FULL level. Copy the always-on ruleset text from `.agents/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` (the body, minus frontmatter) verbatim, with an attribution line: "Ponytail ruleset by DietrichGebert, MIT, github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail (commit 09c434a). Level: full." Add one line: "Run `ponytail-review` on your own diff before you hand it back."
